setInitialActiveProtocolAdapter
  ├── when the caller does not have DEFAULT_ADMIN_ROLE
  │   └── it should revert
  ├── when no adapter is registered for the protocol ID
  │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoAdapterRegistered
  ├── when the initial active protocol adapter has already been set
  │   └── it should revert with ParentVault__InitialActiveProtocolAdapterAlreadySet
  └── when the caller has DEFAULT_ADMIN_ROLE and the adapter is registered
      ├── it should set initial active protocol adapter set true
      ├── it should set the active protocol adapter
      ├── it should set the active strategy protocol ID
      ├── it should set the active strategy chain selector
      └── it should emit an InitialActiveProtocolAdapterSet event
